[{"client_msg_id":"7839b4f8-3011-489f-87bf-6d7fc2eee2c1","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"無事 400 dev 受け取れました。","ts":"1631714011.345900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"blob_tada","count":11,"users":["U78A6ESHM","U6XP9LZ6V","U022XK5866Q","U9S4G0LJW","U023040U953","UAZ33BKV2","U017BU3UZBQ","UFHQ7TNT0","U7JL1UKKL","U06ECBRTJ","U01BY3SDBRS"]},{"name":"moneybag","count":1,"users":["UNJ2DANJC"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"sA8i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"254864ac-6ec0-4f3a-ba82-88d54db41403","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"さすがに今回は、担当者の方から該当者ですので受け取って下さいというメール来てるので、後から該当者じゃないって言われる事はないと信じたいが。","ts":"1631711882.345600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+N27"}]},{"client_msg_id":"11c1c82d-c543-4e18-8364-6a1e2a849669","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"5月ごろの記事なので、今はまあ大丈夫だと思いたい\nとはいえ、トランザクションのためのデータが取られたら、いろいろ悪さできるのはしょうがない(銀行でいえば送金欄のセッションIDみたいな)","ts":"1631711606.344900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bVA0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7ce12f14-2a14-449b-8af9-0186513c28b7","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"こんな話もあるのか。","ts":"1631711402.343600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"CGj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8b624906-628a-4029-97ab-5c04da1ecef7","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"\u003chttps://note.com/usabdelah/n/nda782c793dd6\u003e","ts":"1631711398.343200","attachments":[{"fallback":"note（ノート）: DEV Protocol のエアドロップでトークンを横取りされた話｜はっさんブログ｜note","id":1,"title":"DEV Protocol のエアドロップでトークンを横取りされた話｜はっさんブログ｜note","title_link":"https://note.com/usabdelah/n/nda782c793dd6","text":"Dev Protocol からの 26万円分の DEV トークンがフロントランニングされた話です。 Dev Protocol という「OSSをトークン化して持続可能に変える」というコンセプトを掲げたプロジェクトがあります。先日、その DEV が Airdrop を開始することを知ったので早速参加してみました。総額2億はすごいですね。\u0026amp;nbsp; 自分の GitHub アカウントでいくらもらえるか試してみたところ、まさかの日本円で 26万円！！早速受け取ろうとします。 受け取りでは Iroiro というサイトに飛んだ後 Metamask を接","image_url":"https://assets.st-note.com/production/uploads/images/53362455/rectangle_large_type_2_521db17b4434a35d06341f5025bf6189.jpeg?fit=bounds\u0026quality=85\u0026width=1280","blocks":null,"service_name":"note（ノート）","service_icon":"https://d291vdycu0ht11.cloudfront.net/nuxt/static/metaicon/apple-touch-icon.png","from_url":"https://note.com/usabdelah/n/nda782c793dd6","original_url":"https://note.com/usabdelah/n/nda782c793dd6"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"exX1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"19c69e8c-fa11-4c65-8c81-caa2edccbd26","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"微妙なので dev protocol の人に聞いた。","ts":"1631710765.343000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qigi3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"91d03704-7b48-4087-a194-6ffad6c307c6","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"いま gas 低いから、今のうちに処理したいなぁw","ts":"1631710700.342700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U3Xdc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"426d43f8-7815-4f53-b6d4-6937eeb9e7bf","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"自分も覚えてませんが、いろいろ項目があり、受け取り400DEV(など)とgas代と、手持ちETHが出ると思いますが...","ts":"1631710677.342400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"63J"}]},{"client_msg_id":"668772fd-1b01-406e-bb22-f9f3d125faf9","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"そこは 0 で ok って事なんですかね？","ts":"1631710619.341600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UzN="}]},{"client_msg_id":"272a2c96-95d7-4ec9-8a0c-c71f2de9a792","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"はい、そこです\nMetaMaskのウィンドウで署名というか受け取り処理のgas支払いになるはずです","ts":"1631710577.341300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"d